<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Arthuis sees EU leaders agreeing budget pact.</title>
<headline>Arthuis sees EU leaders agreeing budget pact.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Friday he expected European Union leaders would be able to agree on a post-single currency stability pact when they met later on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is nothing left which is of a nature to prevent an agreement (today) on the stability pact,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
